  "taste_note": "Taste is how well a model one-shots loosely specified work judged by eye (layout, spacing, hierarchy, polish, tone) beyond what its intelligence predicts. value.py derives it, in AA points, as each model's Design Arena overall Elo (DA, human votes on blind design tournaments) minus the Elo a straight-line fit on AA predicts. Roles with a taste weight count it that many times (design 2, Gabriel's ask: double whatever the leaderboard says). DA as of 2026-10-05; 6.1 Sol is unrated, so its DA is GPT-6 Sol's. Retune by updating DA scores."
